  "title": "Joint static and frequency identification of Young modulus and density",
  "kind": "theory",
  "source": "For the two-element fixed-root consistent axial rod, the static tip displacement is FL/(EA), while the first frequency is f0(E,rho)=8.110128166520553 sqrt(E/1000) / sqrt(rho) Hz. These two independent relations separate E and rho.",
